  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The exchange project between Melhus kommune and Taveta Sub County is within the area primary health care. Health personell from Kenya and Norway will gain experience in working with health care services. The exchange of knowledge will contribute to a more sustainable development for both communities. Kenya.</narrative>
